## Revenue Model

Nama: Staking Fee (Protocol Fee pada eETH staking rewards)
Status: Live
Sources: https://docs.ether.fi/staking, https://docs.ether.fi/tokens/eeth, https://app.ether.fi

Nama: Restaking Fee / EigenLayer Strategy Fee (Fee pada restaking rewards via EigenLayer AVS delegation)
Status: Live
Sources: https://docs.ether.fi/restaking, https://docs.eigenlayer.xyz, https://blog.ether.fi/etherfi-v2-liquid-restaking/

Nama: Vault Management Fee (Fee pada EtherFi Vaults untuk institutional-grade restaking allocation)
Status: Live
Sources: https://docs.ether.fi/vaults, https://blog.ether.fi

Nama: weETH Bridging Fee (Fee pada cross-chain bridging weETH via canonical/third-party bridge)
Status: Live
Sources: https://docs.ether.fi/bridging, https://docs.ether.fi/tokens/weeth

Nama: EtherFi Cash Revenue (Interchange fee, yield spread dari spending yield restaked ETH/stablecoin)
Status: Live
Sources: https://cash.ether.fi, https://blog.ether.fi

Nama: Fee Switch / Protocol Revenue Sharing ke ETHFI Token Holder (Governance-activated fee accrual)
Status: Planned / Governance Proposal (EV-024 2024-10 proposal untuk fee switch — outcome perlu verifikasi di Snapshot)
Sources: https://snapshot.org/#/etherfi.eth, https://docs.ether.fi/governance, https://blog.ether.fi

Nama: MEV / Priority Fee dari Validator Operation (via Ultra Light Node operator set)
Status: Live (terdistribusi ke staker via eETH rebase, portion ke protocol fee jika dikonfigurasi)
Sources: https://docs.ether.fi/ultra-light-node, https://docs.ether.fi/restaking

Nama: Grant / Ecosystem Incentive Revenue (Token incentives dari EigenLayer, Symbiotic, L2 foundations untuk bootstrapping TVL)
Status: Live
Sources: https://docs.eigenlayer.xyz, https://docs.symbiotic.fi, https://blog.ether.fi

## Revenue History

Tidak diungkap. EtherFi tidak mempublikasikan laporan pendapatan berkala (quarterly/monthly revenue report) secara resmi. Data on-chain fee collection dapat ditrack via smart contract event tapi tidak diagregasikan ke laporan keuangan publik.
Sources: https://docs.ether.fi, https://blog.ether.fi, https://dune.com/queries?query=etherfi

