Grant: Ecosystem grants dari EigenLayer, Symbiotic, L2 foundations (Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Mode, Blast, Linea, Scroll, zkSync, Mantle, BNB Chain) untuk liquidity mining dan TVL incentives (MEDIUM) [https://docs.eigenlayer.xyz, https://docs.symbiotic.fi, https://docs.ether.fi]
DAO Treasury: Protocol fees terkumpul di DAO treasury, dikelola via governance (MEDIUM) [https://docs.ether.fi/governance, https://snapshot.org/#/etherfi.eth]
Protocol Revenue: Staking fee, restaking fee, vault fee, bridging fee, EtherFi Cash revenue (LIVE) (HIGH) [https://docs.ether.fi/staking, https://docs.ether.fi/restaking, https://docs.ether.fi/vaults, https://docs.ether.fi/bridging, https://cash.ether.fi]
Bootstrapping: Initial development funded by founders + seed investors sebelum revenue live (MEDIUM) [https://x.com/mike_etherfi, https://x.com/rok_etherfi]

