Grant Program: L2 Foundation Grants (Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Mode, Blast, Linea, Scroll, zkSync, Mantle, BNB Chain) — weETH deployment incentives, liquidity mining (MEDIUM) [https://docs.ether.fi, https://blog.ether.fi]
Revenue: Protocol fees (staking, restaking, vault, bridging, EtherFi Cash) — primary sustainable revenue source post-TGE (HIGH) [https://docs.ether.fi/staking, https://docs.ether.fi/restaking, https://docs.ether.fi/vaults, https://docs.ether.fi/bridging, https://cash.ether.fi]
DAO: EtherFi DAO treasury management, fee switch governance, parameter control (MEDIUM) [https://docs.ether.fi/governance, https://snapshot.org/#/etherfi.eth]
Sources: https://labs.binance.com/portfolio, https://docs.eigenlayer.xyz, https://docs.symbiotic.fi, https://docs.ether.fi, https://snapshot.org/#/etherfi.eth

## Financial Risk

Treasury Concentration: Treasury composition tidak diungkap — risiko konsentrasi aset (ETHFI token, ETH, stablecoin) tidak dapat diverifikasi. (MEDIUM) [https://docs.ether.fi/governance, https://snapshot.org/#/etherfi.eth]
Revenue Decline: Protocol revenue bergantung pada ETH staking yield, EigenLayer restaking yield, dan TVL — bear market mengurangi yield dan TVL, menurunkan fee revenue. (HIGH) [https://docs.ether.fi/staking, https://docs.ether.fi/restaking, https://defillama.com/protocol/etherfi]
Funding Dependency: Early-stage bergantung pada VC funding (Binance Labs, Coinbase Ventures, OKX Ventures) — post-TGE transisi ke protocol revenue + DAO treasury. (HIGH) [https://labs.binance.com/portfolio, https://research.binance.com/en/projects/etherfi]
Debt: Tidak ada pinjaman/utang yang dikonfirmasi publik. (LOW) [Tidak ada sumber]
Legal Financial Risk: Regulatory uncertainty pada liquid staking/restaking (SEC stance pada staking-as-a-service, LST sebagai security), potential enforcement action mempengaruhi revenue model dan token status. (MEDIUM) [https://www.sec.gov, https://docs.ether.fi, https://blog.ether.fi]
Smart Contract Risk: Exploit/bug pada core contracts (StakeManager, Vaults, ULN, Bridge) dapat menguras treasury/user funds — dimitigasi audit tapi residual risk ada. (HIGH) [https://docs.ether.fi/security/audits, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/audits]
Bridge Risk: Cross-chain weETH bridging mengandalkan canonical/third-party bridge — bridge hack/exploit dapat menyebabkan loss of funds dan reputational damage. (HIGH) [https://docs.ether.fi/bridging, https://docs.layerzero.network, https://docs.wormhole.com]
Slashing Risk: EigenLayer/Symbiotic slashing dapat mengurangi nilai eETH/weETH, mempengaruhi TVL dan fee revenue. (HIGH) [https://docs.eigenlayer.xyz/slashing, https://docs.symbiotic.fi, https://docs.ether.fi/restaking]
Sources: https://docs.ether.fi/security/audits, https://docs.eigenlayer.xyz/slashing, https://docs.ether.fi/governance, https://defillama.com/protocol/etherfi

